WEBVTT

00:01:59.803 --> 00:02:03.692
So for about $50 of hardware,
you can have your own whiteboard.

00:02:03.716 --> 00:02:05.899
This is Adobe Photoshop.

00:02:05.923 --> 00:02:11.588
(Applause)

00:02:11.612 --> 00:02:12.668
Thank you.

00:02:12.692 --> 00:02:14.325
(Laughter)

00:02:14.349 --> 00:02:16.960
The software for this
I've actually put on my website

00:02:16.984 --> 00:02:18.991
and have let people download it for free.

00:02:19.015 --> 00:02:21.386
In the three months
this project has been public,

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:23.678
it's been downloaded
over half a million times.

00:02:23.702 --> 00:02:25.943
So teachers and students
all around the world

00:02:25.967 --> 00:02:27.313
are already using this.

00:02:27.337 --> 00:02:32.736
(Applause)